[归一化后的问题]
在架商品数是多少？

[已审查的查询计划]
{
  "assets": [
    {
      "asset": "product",
      "join_key": null
    }
  ],
  "blocking_issues": [],
  "dimensions": [],
  "filters": [
    "on_sale = true"
  ],
  "grain": "sku（存量快照，无时间粒度）",
  "limit": 1,
  "metrics": [
    {
      "caliber": "在架商品数 on_sale_product_cnt：COUNT(*) WHERE on_sale = true；存量维表快照计数，不去重、不区分时间区间；谓词写 on_sale = true（不用 on_sale <> false，避免漏掉 on_sale IS NULL 的行）",
      "name": "on_sale_product_cnt"
    }
  ],
  "order_by": [],
  "output_columns": [
    "on_sale_product_cnt"
  ],
  "time_range": {
    "end": null,
    "start": null
  }
}

